---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How It Works | GovLink" pathname="/how-it-works">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 mobile:py-12">
    <h1 class="type-site-hero text-center mb-8">How GovLink Works</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-12">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">1. Ask Your Question</h2>
        <p>Type or speak your question in plain language — no need to know which agency handles what. For example: "How do I replace my Social Security card?" or "I'm a veteran. How do I get care?"</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">2. We Search Official Sources</h2>
        <p>GovLink queries official government APIs and .gov websites in real time. We search across 29,000+ federal web properties so you don't have to.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">3. You Get a Clear Answer with Citations</h2>
        <p>Every answer includes links to the official source — the specific agency page, form, or regulation. You can always verify the information yourself.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">4. Next Steps</h2>
        <p>Beyond the answer, we show you what to do next: forms to fill, offices to call, documents to gather, or deadlines to meet.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-border-primary" />

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Privacy by Design</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>No accounts, no tracking, no ads</li>
          <li>Questions processed in real-time, not stored</li>
          <li>Preferences (theme, language) kept in your browser only</li>
          <li>All connections encrypted (HTTPS)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Source Transparency</h2>
        <p>Every answer shows exactly which .gov website or API provided the information. Click any citation to visit the official source directly.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Accessibility</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>WCAG 2.1 AA compliant</li>
          <li>Full keyboard navigation</li>
          <li>Screen reader optimized</li>
          <li>Reduced motion support</li>
          <li>High contrast mode compatible</li>
          <li>Voice input supported</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Supported Languages</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>English</li>
          <li>Español (Spanish)</li>
          <li>Français (French)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">More languages coming soon.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">File Upload</h2>
        <p>Upload PDFs, documents, or images to get help with specific forms, letters, or notices you've received from government agencies.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>